const security=()=>pageShell(`<section class="section security-system"><div class="wrap"><div class="security-boundary"><div><h2>Keep the evidence boundary explicit.</h2><p>Send only what the record requires, choose where it runs, and keep every privileged action attributable.</p></div><div class="boundary-map" aria-label="Security and deployment boundary"><span class="boundary-input">OTLP spans</span><i>→</i><div><b>YOUR EVIDENCE BOUNDARY</b><strong>Lians</strong><small>private cloud · self-hosted · managed</small></div><i>→</i><span class="boundary-output">Verified receipt</span></div></div><div class="security-grid"><article><span>01</span><h2>Control the boundary.</h2><p>Send only the telemetry required for the evidence record. Deploy self-hosted when the workflow cannot leave your environment.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h2>Verify integrity.</h2><p>Append-only audit events and linked hashes make later changes detectable. Verification results travel with exported receipts.</p><div class="hash-line"><i>7f2a</i><b>→</b><i>b91c</i><b>→</b><i>18df</i></div></article><article><span>03</span><h2>Limit access.</h2><p>API keys, scoped administrative actions, and review controls keep evidence access explicit and attributable.</p><div class="scope-list"><span>evidence:read</span><span>receipt:export</span><span>review:approve</span></div></article><article><span>04</span><h2>Ask before assuming.</h2><p>Security requirements vary. We document the exact deployment, controls, and responsibilities before implementation begins.</p></article></div><div class="security-contact"><p>No implied certifications. No inherited vendor claims.</p><a class="button" href="mailto:security@lians.ai">Contact security →</a></div></div></section>`);
